translation:
Gold bell, jade bell, what kind of world is this?
In the country, there are loyal subjects;
to parents, there are filial children;
among siblings, there is brotherly love;
among relatives, there is harmony.
Baby, baby, our baby is sleeping soundly, sleeping soundly.

